  {
    "sha": "df3934ae7d3a2c5a28e4269c424de1f03a7127fd",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOAPHdINoAKGRmMzkzNGFlN2QzYTJjNWEyOGU0MjY5YzQyNGRlMWYwM2E3MTI3ZmQ",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "sabrimete",
        "email": "sabrimete99@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-10-15T17:31:12Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "rfjakob",
        "email": "jakobunt@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-10-17T18:33:47Z"
      },
      "message": "Fix -Wsign-conversion warnings in timespec initialisers on older GCC\n\nOlder GCC (reproduced with GCC 6; the report also lists GCC 8) warns\nthat \"conversion to 'long int' from 'unsigned int' may change the sign\nof the result\" for the tv_nsec initialisers in kill_wait() and\npoll_loop() because poll_ms/sleep_ms are unsigned. Cast to long before\nthe multiplication; tv_nsec is long.\n\nFixes #360\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "4e5116aba0247917340d7a30f7efddc9ab5d9507",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rfjakob/earlyoom/git/trees/4e5116aba0247917340d7a30f7efddc9ab5d9507"
      },
