        "date": "2025-09-13T13:34:07Z"
      },
      "message": "Implement -P to invoke a program as pre-hook before killing a process\n\nThis implements an option to invoke an external program, analog to the\nexisting \"-N\" (which runs a program after killing a process), but\nbeing executed before sending signals to the process, with purposes\nsuch as gathering some specific info of the running process.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "7ca219a76804cf6a8fd0cabb2c606e4f40b09552",
