  {
    "sha": "269f7f1c8b2f7739e69be69812b3f97f82305b8a",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOAPHdINoAKDI2OWY3ZjFjOGIyZjc3MzllNjliZTY5ODEyYjNmOTdmODIzMDViOGE",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "Fabrice Fontaine",
        "email": "fontaine.fabrice@gmail.com",
        "date": "2022-07-28T08:05:18Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "rfjakob",
        "email": "jakobunt@gmail.com",
        "date": "2022-10-21T19:36:03Z"
      },
      "message": "main.c: fix build with kernel < 4.3\n\nPR_CAP_AMBIENT is only available since kernel 4.3 and\nhttps://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/58319057b7847667f0c9585b9de0e8932b0fdb08\nresulting in the following build failure since version 1.7 and\nhttps://github.com/rfjakob/earlyoom/commit/9edc5cfc9ad794ed59baec5e6ee8d1060456a315:\n\nmain.c: In function 'main':\nmain.c:119:11: error: 'PR_CAP_AMBIENT' undeclared (first use in this function)\n     prctl(PR_CAP_AMBIENT, PR_CAP_AMBIENT_CLEAR_ALL, 0, 0, 0);\n           ^\n\nFixes:\n - http://autobuild.buildroot.org/results/5a0ad7e1f6de3c37e40c37d8f583fc699a457753\n\nSigned-off-by: Fabrice Fontaine <fontaine.fabrice@gmail.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "30360d8e3e4dcc8cded46bb8682873700539c92d",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rfjakob/earlyoom/git/trees/30360d8e3e4dcc8cded46bb8682873700539c92d"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rfjakob/earlyoom/git/commits/269f7f1c8b2f7739e69be69812b3f97f82305b8a",
